WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Movement includes everyday activity as
well as exercise. Choose an option that

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
fits your ability, circumstances and
available support.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Aerobic activity, muscle challenge, and
balance or functional activity contribute

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
in different ways. Minutes alone do not
tell the whole story.

5
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Choose a manageable opportunity and
consider what would make it easier. A

6
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.000
weekly target is not a pass or fail test.

7
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Use guidance appropriate to your age and
circumstances. The Explorer illustrates

8
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:48.000
selected settings; it does not measure
your body or decide what is safe for you.
